B.Ux=new A.aV("What do proponents say is the main advantage of gig work?",B.MS,1,'Proponents argue it "offers unprecedented flexibility."')
B.Lz=s(["Too much free time","Lack of benefits and income security","Boring work","Too many regulations"],t.s)
B.Uq=new A.aV("What do critics highlight as a key problem?",B.Lz,1,"Critics point to lack of health insurance, paid leave, retirement contributions, and guaranteed income.")
B.Px=s(["Workers prefer it","To avoid providing mandated benefits","It is legally required","For tax purposes only"],t.s)
