B.KS=s(["Write at least 150 words for Task 1","DO NOT give opinions \u2014 just describe the data","Include an overview paragraph highlighting main trends","Compare data points \u2014 don't just list numbers","Use varied language: increased, rose, climbed, surged, grew"],t.s)
