B.IQ=new A.tf("Section 1: University Accommodation","Good morning, how can I help you today? Hi, I'm looking for accommodation for next semester. I'm a second-year student studying engineering. Of course. We have several options available. First, there's the new hall of residence on campus called Parkview. It's a single room with an en-suite bathroom, and includes all meals. The cost is eight hundred and fifty pounds per month. Alternatively, we have shared apartments off campus on Bridge Street. You'd share with three other students. Each person has their own bedroom, but the kitchen and bathroom are shared. That's five hundred and twenty pounds per month, and you arrange your own meals. There's also a homestay option where you live with a local family. That includes breakfast and dinner, and it's six hundred and seventy-five pounds per month. When would I need to move in? The semester starts on the fifteenth of September, but you can move in from the tenth. I'd recommend the earlier date so you can settle in before classes begin.","A conversation between a student and an accommodation officer about housing options.",B.Nc)
